{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_013_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_013_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9ebbaf1a20b94a8ed28fb7235bca24b61b845c9882b4ad77edc45da7d01525e", "ja": "……公演の時の……杏奈の、ウキウキ…………、\n読んでくれた人に……伝えたかった……から……。", "zh": "……因为杏奈……想将公演时……兴奋的心情…………\n传达给……阅读的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
